<td id="S4.T1.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_t">96.8</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">GPT-4.1</td>
